data: {"type":"response.completed","sequence_number":2012,"response":{"id":"resp_041ba8b48e51d02f016adb42b0bea881919d365a2202cfbc0f","object":"response","created_at":1792754352,"completed_at":1792754371,"status":"completed","background":false,"frequency_penalty":0.0,"presence_penalty":0.0,"moderation":null,"model":"gpt-6-luna","access_programs":null,"previous_response_id":null,"instructions":"Complete the supplied mathematical task using only its explicit inputs and tools. Submit the requested JSON artifact through submit_artifact. Tool feedback is real task feedback; do not invent a successful check. This is a Yui workflow stage. Read the relevant declared Yui rules, preserve the supplied proof route and exact allowed assumptions, and distinguish mathematical review from structural checks.","output":[{"type":"reasoning","id":"rs_041ba8b48e51d02f016adb42b346888191abd8f3a65284c840","summary":[],"content":[],"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABq20KzveNpxfWfDnoCE9_JRUFRBCKgplpy78vNmX6TRcDxT_3rECEX9v1orExirrxCj1kDAfUtJvYvTvyMdXfp6VAuJ19gZATo813UQlHtERQEeyFgUqJiIuV0r6bl04CinKICNm4JhtC3kdAfIwrDkTWRgKy29H9axgvMbeSI2hYMitSvsrOXOLJAlIAzn_zh8jGeNfsrg8lcxw4juNvQAsM1HpF_pYIu-4MRi5WbWqz7QgwqN_7SYJD_g6Dmjp_cMNGzDbyL_mOywPC5nyZorIzyTgcRHEb-jtAQbqiEdIF62ks003sBfIH605M672HioxGAUwCSXRrahr6vcAhhTSDKlRnVYVTuEsA2LNQVj69F9tsxP4sYaP8914Bxq8G_LjFLrVfUi9STEAZRVZBU507KQdqY0qY6ZtErrRsYIWl4gMyY8sQTIyFfUNgwnfIU2FRjNRvSbJ3bEr3Rqn8r2-CWhc92lNL8AxK5rn0YhEs-ebBxOrIyR4U4HW2ckeQf2DojBvCMFR9QdkNqIsKDlbsYqZbUY-JBP5P29LNMnQblW83qYBgVKt8hhWDGwhzp4GmsJ2lpFH_Cc1e0QECwxD8_dsajjQ1a17XlxQuiS-K--FtI053PXXqB-evHnPcWpjz9XxrED02CAA901T3to9iLtQb8O57wL2-PCB39av2jQL6FMJDb-TnA7-FZUdkpTdL1DPuPyr5BaZrymj5Z3CCiN7tKaRzEDuI2QDiaaNp4UqQtlGXXriH0Jsh0fa5bNApH1STfhNyt84Kh1CKoCH_o2zHpCzcyy_-1-7DZweAU8PCvP1xu9jhYPT1AFXsEbaXNRynLT7AzgTm2X2eDQNWc1G_ZsmYyYuHeuxsz3hTP-HN_EgvmpwK6hnfzFTi81mKzyk3QJFYIENYSVU1mX0PEtk3fkS4_F4HNN3xgkfIOxmDWz9-l2N6IcD8OI2GZ1wHOU8lKwQ6mgZ2kx16CEPQ1yhzHzdwtHOD0zGwEe6YCRy4zGi7w-l7o48yeXczwhnDU2HlW4oybKr1ZfkWn0MkjHR6